{"availability":"available","full":"PeterDaveHello/chkdomain","name":"chkdomain","description":"🔍 Discover if a domain is resolvable or blocked by secure DNS and Ad-blocking services, and experience the innovative idea of DaaS - DNS as an Intelligence Service.","category":"Other","language":"Shell","stars":84,"forks":19,"created":"2022-02-20T14:08:39Z","updated":"2026-09-25T16:22:40Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":["adblock","cybersecurity","dns","domain","filter","hacktoberfest","infosec","malware","osint","phishing","security","threat-intelligence"],"demo":"https://asciinema.org/a/474151","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:06:16.851Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T21:06:16.851Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T21:06:16.851Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T21:06:16.851Z","stars":84,"forks":19}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["chkdomain checks if a domain can be resolved by no-filter DNS, or has been blocked by secure/protective DNS, and advertisement/tracker-blocking DNS services. It sends queries to well-known DNS servers and checks the resolution success as a basis for determining if the domain is blocked. The tool also provides links to OSINT, domain threat intelligence, and security services for the domain in question.","The DNS services currently used for sending queries are listed below:","After checking the domain, chkdomain provides direct links to the following intelligence services for more information:"],"features":["AlienVault Open Threat Exchange","Bitdefender TrafficLight","Google Safe Browsing","Kaspersky Threat Intelligence Portal","Yandex Site safety report"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PeterDaveHello/chkdomain/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"d9b95148912e66f6b2fab50bf955320ab377fdf69208d5c71c36145070a46824","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T21:06:17.184Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:06:17.184Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text